fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"play/gstplay.html#gst_play_message_parse_error","fragment":"\n\tgst_play_message_parse_error\n\n\n\tGstPlay.PlayMessage.prototype.parse_error\n\n\n\tGstPlay.PlayMessage.parse_error\n\nParse the given error msg and extract the corresponding GError.\nSince 1.26 the details will always contain the URI this refers to in an\n\"uri\" field of type string, and (if known) the string \"stream-id\" it is\nreferring to.\nParameters:\nA GstMessage\nthe resulting error\nA GstStructure containing additional details about the error\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.20\n\t\t\nParse the given error msg and extract the corresponding GError (not introspectable).\nSince 1.26 the details will always contain the URI this refers to in an\n\"uri\" field of type string, and (if known) the string \"stream-id\" it is\nreferring to.\nParameters:\nA Gst.Message\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.20\n\t\t\nParse the given error msg and extract the corresponding GError (not introspectable).\nSince 1.26 the details will always contain the URI this refers to in an\n\"uri\" field of type string, and (if known) the string \"stream-id\" it is\nreferring to.\nParameters:\nA Gst.Message\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.20\n\t\t\n"});